### 6. Core\ImageProcessor Class

**File:** `/c/Users/edn_y/renew_nineonelabs/src/Core/ImageProcessor.php` (lines 1-68)

```php
class ImageProcessor {
    public const MAX_WIDTH = 2560;
    public const WEBP_QUALITY = 82;
    public const CONVERTIBLE = ['jpg', 'jpeg', 'png', 'gif'];

    public static function makeWebpSibling(string $absolutePath): bool {
        // Check file exists
        if (!is_file($absolutePath)) return false;

        // Skip non-convertible formats (SVG, ICO)
        $ext = strtolower(pathinfo($absolutePath, PATHINFO_EXTENSION));
        if (!in_array($ext, self::CONVERTIBLE, true)) return false;

        // FILENAME PATTERN: Replace extension, NOT append
        $webpPath = preg_replace('/\.[^.]+$/', '.webp', $absolutePath);
        // Example: /uploads/works/foo.jpg → /uploads/works/foo.webp

        try {
            $image = Image::load($absolutePath);

            // Auto-resize if > 2560px wide
            $size = @getimagesize($absolutePath);
            if (is_array($size) && isset($size[0]) && $size[0] > self::MAX_WIDTH) {
                $image->width(self::MAX_WIDTH);
            }

            $image->format('webp')
                ->quality(self::WEBP_QUALITY)
                ->save($webpPath);

            return is_file($webpPath);
        } catch (Throwable $e) {
            error_log('[ImageProcessor] webp sibling failed: ' . $e->getMessage());
            return false;  // Swallow error, don't break upload
        }
    }

    public static function deleteWebpSibling(string $absolutePath): bool {
        $ext = strtolower(pathinfo($absolutePath, PATHINFO_EXTENSION));
        if (!in_array($ext, self::CONVERTIBLE, true)) return false;

        $webpPath = preg_replace('/\.[^.]+$/', '.webp', $absolutePath);
        if (is_file($webpPath)) {
            return @unlink($webpPath);
        }
        return false;
    }
}
```

**Critical Details:**
- **WebP filename format:** `foo.jpg` → `foo.webp` (NOT `foo.jpg.webp`)
- Silently fails on errors (line 45: error logged, no exception thrown)
- Auto-resize to 2560px max width
- Quality: 82 (good balance)
- Convertible formats only: `jpg`, `jpeg`, `png`, `gif`
- SVG/ICO are skipped (safe, as they don't need compression)

